# moonlight-web
===
 Play your PC games anywhere, directly in your browser. A web-based Moonlight client for streaming Sunshine games with ultra-low latency, full gamepad support, high-quality video streaming (H.264, HEVC, AV1), and intelligent upscaling algorithms for sharper visuals.
